WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:03.000
[A pencil meets textured paper. A thought.]
[Quiet room texture; a soft graphite stroke.]

00:03.000 --> 00:07.000
[An intentionally stylized sculpted hand draws “What if?”]
Given a little care.

00:07.000 --> 00:14.000
[Sketch lines rise from the page into two folded surfaces.]
Intention, given form.

00:14.000 --> 00:18.000
Business websites.
[Typography and spacing are adjusted on an illustrative design.]

00:18.000 --> 00:21.000
Custom web applications.
[A request moves through review to ready.]

00:21.000 --> 00:24.000
Backend systems & integrations.
[Separate components become connected.]

00:24.000 --> 00:27.000
[Light grazes brushed violet and silver metal.]
[A restrained tonal progression gathers.]

00:27.000 --> 00:35.000
[Two metallic ribbons unfold, turn, and resolve into an emblem.]

00:35.000 --> 00:42.000
IDIOMORPH STUDIO.
From ideas to what’s next.
[The exact supplied logo holds. Sound resolves into silence.]
